Footnote: ⁎ The theory of vowel tones was first enunciated by Wheatstone in a criticism, unfortunately little known, on Willis's experiments. The latter are described in the *Transactions of the Cambridge Philosophical Society*, vol. iii. p. 231, @@FN@@
